  "content": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "Linear relationships are the backbone of the algebra domain: solving for a variable, reading slope and intercept, and handling two equations at once.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "thm",
        "label": {
          "en": "▲ Reference — Lines &amp; systems",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Slope-intercept form is \\( y=mx+b \\); slope \\( =\\dfrac{y_2-y_1}{x_2-x_1} \\). Solve a system by <strong>substitution</strong> or <strong>elimination</strong> — or graph both lines in Desmos and read the intersection.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "cards",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Slope-intercept",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( y=mx+b \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Point-slope",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( y-y_1=m(x-x_1) \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Slope",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\dfrac{y_2-y_1}{x_2-x_1} \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "System",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "substitute / eliminate",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 1.A",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Solve \\( 3x+5=20 \\).</p>\\[ 3x=15,\\qquad x=5. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 1.B",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Solve the system \\( x+y=10 \\), \\( x-y=2 \\).</p><p>Add the equations: \\( 2x=12 \\).</p>\\[ x=6,\\ y=4. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "quizWidget": {
    "enabled": true
  }
}
